 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Popcorn, fruit kebabs, burritos, cheese and crackers, fruit salads, dips and soups are all good choices. If it' kept on a tray with a lid, it's usually fine. Cooked meat and bread sweat a lot, so keep an eye on tray and the food. You could do a vegetarian burger with a cheese topping. Pop some fruit in a butter lining tray and bake it in the oven until the juices caramelise. It' like baked fruit, but you can keep it open.",
